+/// Emits cuda-device's private indexed read for a host-validated device
+/// address/count pair.
+///
+/// `ReadOnlyRange` is the Rust proof owner: its constructor is host-only and
+/// its upper-bound loop maintains `retval + half < len`. This boundary keeps
+/// the pointer and signed count in their CUB `SearchTransform` representation
+/// instead of reconstructing a fat slice in every unrolled channel.
